# CarPlay maneuver snapshot (hud_send.cpp g_snapshot) is a seqlock: the
# hud_on_* producers write it between two g_seq increments and sender_main
# copies it without a lock, retrying when g_seq is odd or changed. TSan cannot
# model that, so the producers' plain writes are reported as races. Only
# these writer functions are suppressed; any other race still reports.
race:hud_on_next_turn
race:hud_on_distance
race:hud_on_status
